# Keep binary course files byte-exact on checkout.
#
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites line endings in anything Git decides is
# text. A small uncompressed PDF looks like text, so Git was rewriting
# sample_resume.pdf on clone - which shifts every byte offset in its xref
# table and makes readers fall back to rescanning the file. Marking these
# extensions binary stops that.
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.db binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
